					"nextDialogs": [
						105020431,
						105020433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020431,
					"content": "没有面子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020432
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020432,
					"content": "是的，如果我和这些俗人生活在一起，占星术士的心境要怎么维持…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020435,
					"content": "那也没办法，不然你就只能回去见你的师父。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020436,
					"content": "别、别说了！那、那，就先这样吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020437,
					"content": "我决定了，暂时住在蒙德城吧。等老太婆的命数到了尽头，我就自由了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020438,
						105020439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020438,
					"content": "真是过分坚定的觉悟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020440
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020440,
					"content": "可是，占星术的研究要怎么办…不对，首先连住的地方都没有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020441,
					"content": "关于这个，我们去问一下<color=#00E1FFFF>冒险家协会的凯瑟琳小姐</color>，能不能帮忙吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020442,
					"content": "冒险家协会？嗯…对，如果能通过接他们的委托，换取…嗯，你懂吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020443,
						105020444
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020443,
					"content": "了解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020445
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020445,
					"content": "唔，谢谢…那个，我…算了，没什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020444,
					"content": "本来也是这么打算的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020445
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020439,
					"content": "这也算是「暂时」吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020440
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020433,
					"content": "没有钱？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020434
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020434,
					"content": "是…唔，不是！你还真是不会说话啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020425,
					"content": "对可莉发脾气也是没用的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020426
					]
				}
			]
		},
