					"content": "只要回去和凯瑟琳报告一下，应该就可以住进去了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020607,
					"content": "不必了不必了，太谢谢你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020608,
					"content": "这位是…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020609,
					"content": "哦，我是这栋房子的主人，歌德。刚刚路过冒险家协会的时候，凯瑟琳告诉了我这件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020610,
					"content": "没想到这么快，这个烦人的封印就被解开了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020611,
					"content": "那就是说，我可以住在这里了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020612,
					"content": "当然当然，反正里面的设备放着也是放着，能有人发挥它们的价值，我也很开心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020613,
					"content": "为了表示感谢，我可以用最低最低的价格，把房子租给你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020614,
					"content": "租、租？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020615,
					"content": "来之前没听说租的事，而且我还帮了忙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020616,
					"content": "帮忙？嗯，对，我明白啊。我非常感谢你，所以租金肯定会给你最优惠的价格！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020617,
					"content": "我、我的意思是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020618,
					"content": "看来莫娜有些误解，但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020619,
						105020620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020619,
					"content": "这可能是最好的选择了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020621,
					"content": "唉…也没有别的办法了，就租这里吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020622,
					"content": "好！那就这么说定了，我去准备一下手续，稍等片刻吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歌德"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020623,
					"content": "这次的事，谢谢了。还有就是…很对不起，答应你的事，暂时还做不到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020624,
					"content": "没有占星需要的设备，也没有新的知识，想要看清你的「命运」，还需要一些时间…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020625,
					"content": "但我答应你，等我准备好了，我一定会第一个为你占卜的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020626,
						105020628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020626,
					"content": "如你所说，这次旅程有益无害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020627,
					"content": "谢谢你，能和你同行是我的命运——而且，算是「好运」的那一边吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020630,
					"content": "祝你们的冒险一路顺风！我…也要想想以后的事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020631,
					"content": "如果她不用占星术赚钱，要怎么活下去呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020632,
					"content": "…我们还是偶尔回来看看她吧？要是饿晕在房间里，就不好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020628,
					"content": "总之先努力活下去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020629
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105020629,
					"content": "嗯…虽然我不知道该怎么办，但…我会努力的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105020620,
					"content": "摩拉攒一攒总是会有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105020621
					]
				}
			]
		},
